>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Manually reviewed Lewis representation. Ligand dimensions in reported compound 2a support two monoanionic semiquinonediimine radicals. Use Co(III) and two L•⁻ ligands, Count the additional ligand as tert-butylpyridine or I⁻ according to the corresponding structure. The measured total spin is S=0; The two local radical flags give one assignment of the delocalized electrons. Localized 18 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. The atom order and coordinates of all 72 atoms agree between XYZ and SDF. Lengths of 73 nonmetal covalent bonds: 73 within range, 0 outside range and 0 with sparse controls. Use the supplied Lewis representation for scoring; Independent evidence for the complete graph is limited.

