>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Interactively reviewed graph. W–N–O 167.87°, N–O 1.21290 Å, g-xTB N–O WBO 1.4448. The closed-shell assignment for this near-linear terminal ligand is N≡[O+], with metal formal charge +0 and total charge +0. The published crystal structure locates both the nitrosyl and ancillary ligands; Formal net charges on the ancillary ligands were also checked against the same-ID tmQMg-L record. The coordination environment, original bond angle, lengths and bond orders support the NO⁺ limiting form. Localized 11 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. The atom order and coordinates of all 66 atoms agree between XYZ and SDF. Lengths of 63 nonmetal covalent bonds: 62 within range, 0 outside range and 1 with sparse controls.

